1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Retention teams rarely lack data.
They lack a trustworthy sequence.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:13,000
SaaS records arrive at different grains,
from accounts to support and churn.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Simple joins inflate metrics, while a final flag
can erase the customer journey.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,000
JourneyGraph tests relationships
and chronology before analysis.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:34,000
The unsafe join expanded 500 accounts
into almost 148 thousand rows.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Invalid chronology is preserved in quarantine,
not silently repaired.

7
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:47,000
This overview shows a fixed
historical snapshot.

8
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:54,000
It starts with 35,586
processed events.

9
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,000
13,927 are usable, while 21,659
remain quarantined.

10
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:05,000
The usable evidence forms
4,221 governed journeys.

11
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:12,000
MAIN includes valid events
plus documented warnings.

12
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:19,000
STRICT keeps only valid events
for sensitivity.

13
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Quarantine is a quality backlog,
never a behavior signal.

14
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:32,000
The Journey Explorer uses
controlled anonymous profiles.

15
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:39,000
It preserves recurrent churn
and explicit reactivation.

16
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Ordered events retain scope,
outcome, and quality context.

17
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Operational account identifiers
are not displayed.

18
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:57,000
The graph promotes only supported
ROBUST or SENSITIVE evidence.

19
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:04,000
It contains 435 patterns
and 43 promoted transitions.

20
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Each retains support, population,
stability, and provenance.

21
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Graph structure is descriptive,
not an explanation of cause.

22
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:22,000
Seven deterministic queues organize
1,609 evidence items.

23
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:29,000
Rules and priority components
remain inspectable.

24
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:35,000
There is no predictive churn score
and no automated customer action.

25
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:42,000
Eight experiment designs turn observations
into testable hypotheses.

26
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:50,000
They are not completed experiments.
Every design remains UNTESTED.

27
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:57,000
JourneyGraph is local and reproducible,
with fixed JSON evidence.

28
00:02:57,000 --> 00:03:02,000
Privacy and interpretation boundaries
remain visible.

29
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:05,000
The next step remains
a human decision.
